- tl.dot_scaled(a_q, a_scale, 'e2m1', b_q, b_scale, 'e2m1', acc=acc)
- LHS scale shape: [BLOCK_M, SCALE_PER_K] where SCALE_PER_K = BLOCK_K_PACKED // 16
- RHS scale shape: [BLOCK_N, SCALE_PER_K]  (N-first per gfx950 hardware constraint)
- BLOCK_K_PACKED min = 64 bytes (hardware minimum for ScaledUpcastFp4Op)

