    B_q is loaded with transposed strides:
      b_tile[k, n] = B_q[offs_n[n], offs_k[k]]
    = B.T[k, n] — giving [BLOCK_K, BLOCK_N] tile without CPU-side transpose.

    Scale layouts:
      a_scale [BLOCK_M, SCALE_PER_K] — LHS, row-major (row = M dim)
      b_scale [BLOCK_N, SCALE_PER_K] — RHS, N-first (gfx950 RHS constraint)
